# Send only the application source needed by Dockerfile. Model weights,
# environments, uploads, outputs, test photographs, credentials and Git history
# never enter the Docker build context.
*
!Dockerfile
!.dockerignore
!requirements.txt
!requirements-base.txt
!app.py
!app.css
!visenlo/
!visenlo/**
!scripts/
!scripts/**
**/__pycache__/
**/*.py[cod]
**/.env*
**/*.log
